WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Every uncommitted change, as one diff

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.000
Press s to list the files beside it

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.200
RET on a file goes to it in the diff

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.000
Press / and type: the list keeps the files that match

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
RET leaves only those files in the review
